hypothesis to preregister for batch_5:
per-pass scatter and rotation are separable, independently judgeable mark-making factors: judges can reliably rank scatter levels (fixed rotation) and rotation levels (fixed scatter) on 2afc pairs, and scatter does not read as rotation or vice versa (no cross-factor confusion above the >=4/5 threshold). secondarily, opacity_falloff reads as 'fading' (alpha ramp) independently of stroke count or overlap density

